Why MPL-2.0, in plain terms:

  * You can use this for anything, including commercially, at no cost.
  * You can build a proprietary product on top of it without opening your
    own code.
  * If you MODIFY a file from this project and ship it, you must publish
    your changes to that file.

That is the whole bargain: improvements to Miscellany itself come back,
and anything you build on top of it stays yours. The full text of the
licence is at the URL above and governs in case of any difference.
